      "value": "I have a new confirmation.\nUsers who set SDK2's world to HOME do not seem to have this problem.\nUsers who set SDK3's world to HOME cannot pick up when they go to SDK2's world and run Spawn Prefab.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
